# Launch/brand kit: 51MB of source artwork and two video files.
#
# Rollout collateral: deliberately not committed. Git keeps every version of a
# binary forever, so a 19MB kit costs 19MB in every clone from now on even after
# it is deleted — and these are exports, regenerated from the design source
# rather than edited here. They are also not for the SITE: the banner goes on an
# X profile, the poster goes to a printer, the press sheet goes in an email.
#
# The three files the site actually serves are un-ignored below and committed in
# place, rather than copied to public/ as the previous kit did it. A copy is the
# thing that silently goes stale — the same argument app/icon.tsx makes for
# rasterising the mark instead of committing a PNG beside it.
public/GREENWOOD/
public/evergreen/*
!public/evergreen/README.md
!public/evergreen/logo/
!public/evergreen/08-og-share-card-1200x630.png
